---
import Card from "../../../ui/Card.astro";

import { Icon } from "@astrojs/starlight/components";
---

<Card className="motion-preset-blur-up">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <Icon name="pen" size="24px" color="#FFFFFF" />
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-50 text-lg">Content & Respect</h3>
    </div>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>
            <span class="font-bold">Don't be an Asshole</span>: Harassment, hate
            speech, or targeted bullying will result in an immediate exit. Treat
            others with the same respect you'd give a peer at a local lounge.
            Use common sense.
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="font-bold">No Politics or Religion</span>: To keep
            things laid-back, we avoid these loaded topics unless if it is a
            HUGE event or a mod permits it.
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="font-bold">Don’t DM without Permission</span>: Please
            respect the privacy of other members. Don't slide into DMs unless
            you’ve cleared it in a public channel first.
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="font-bold">Read the Room</span>: If a topic seems to be
            making people uncomfortable, it’s best to steer the conversation
            elsewhere.
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-200">
        We encourage communication as long as it's respectful and considerate.
        If you have an issue, please address it calmly and privately with the
        involved parties or an admin.
    </p>
</Card>
